  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FA-Sustainable Integrated Development, Western Uganda</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will seek to strengthen local capacity to sustainably manage water, hygiene, sanitation, food security and economic empowerment interventions in the four subcounties of Kiryandongo district by 2023, establish strong alliances with WASH, FFS, VSLA groups, partners and NGOS/CBOs to advocate, lobby and influence government to adopt policies that address households beyond basic needs, and enable others learn from project&#x2019;s good practices.</narrative>
  </description>
